        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rolf de Heer, Joseph M. Newman, Damon Gameau\n- Works: The Tracker, This Island Earth, Love My Way, How I Met Your Mother\n- Roles: film directors, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph M. Newman was born on August 17, 1909, and he was an American film director.\n- Rolf de Heer was born on May 4, 1951, and he is a Dutch Australian film director.\n- Joseph M. Newman was most famous for directing the 1955 film This Island Earth.\n- The Tracker was directed and written by Rolf de Heer.\n- Damon Gameau appeared in the 2002 Australian film The Tracker.\n- Damon Gameau also appeared in the Australian series Love My Way and in a small role in the US series How I Met Your Mother.\n- Joseph M. Newman died on January 23, 2006.",
